          one_liner: 'Where a hungry household learns whether the city remembers it.',
          subject: 'a relief bureau',
          detail:
            'A long porch, a clerk who has read every application twice, and a copper bowl at the door for the rice the bureau does not hand out itself. The form is one page. The wait is longer than the form suggests.',
          tags: ['bureau', 'relief'],
        },
        {
          name: 'The grain inspection house',
          one_liner: 'The wall where every sack is opened and weighed in public.',
          subject: 'a grain inspection hall',
          detail:
